.5771-25/499619680_1393935745408106_5227587196332653476_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=--2sSt0DaD4Q7kNvwGAuONb&_nc_oc=Adq2ruWZqb2TZOlyKm3-UELDDbw2O8nwUaTLwwwdI-qiig-IX2UwSPHmOb1KXHZw57g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9yFjmagx_E_7YmU8p0OhESMF50MtYfWbRtlkz-Aozq5w&oe=6A2C0BAF"}, "display_name": "God of Bath", "keywords": ["Fighting", "battle", "action", "korea", "Comics"], "long_description": "\u201cGOD OF BATH\u201d is a VR adaptation of the popular Korean webtoon The God of Bath.\n\nPlayers use real hand movements to attack and defend in a unique \u201cScrub Fighting\u201d combat system.\n\nThe immersive VR \u201cScrub Time\u201d sequences recreate iconic scenes from the webtoon with a comedic twist, delivering both laughter and excitement.\n\nExperience a new world of VR action comedy filled with dynamic battles, realistic scrubbing action, and unforgettable characters.\n\n\u25a0 Key Features\n{1337823384203149}\n* Scrub Battle Action \u2013 A one-of-a-kind combat system powered by real scrubbing moves!\n{841894742141525}\n* Comedic Scrub Time \u2013 Relive iconic webtoon moments as interactive VR events!\n{1589004808932841}\n* Face Off Against Original Characters \u2013 Fight your way through familiar and unforgettable personalities!\n{1521575192738410}\n* Immersive VR Gameplay \u2013 Every movement you make turns seamlessly into combat and comedy!\n{1199671048730157}\n* Experience the most extraordinary battle ever to take place in a bathhouse!\n\n\nOriginal Comics from NAVER WEBTOON \u24d2Ilkwon Ha All Rights Reserved.", "short_description": "Experience the hit Korean webtoon God of Bath in VR!\nStep into a bathhouse where over-the-top comedy meets intense scrubbing battles.\nFeel the thrill of combat powered by scrubbing moves, and dive into hilarious \u201cscrub time\u201d moments you can experience firsthand!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "IMG_0619.png", "id": "4313722828908122", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618472_4313722832241455_8129084445092545218_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e5siSZ0C1gwQ7kNvwFZRZEN&_nc_oc=AdrTvbRw1S1gJWXmEiUdz4nU7R_zSGjfxU7iZV_AJgqoi2Bb8jrPI-hRfbHpMajpk5o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9Ek-Yt5j3cY9_wrJHDriIrXujmCLHkrDAB_HtIgsQKAQ&oe=6A2C1501"}, {"file_name": "Cubemap_20251106_095857_nologo.png", "id": "1858878011724015", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620817_1858878015057348_1911355417361916343_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xFnsB4hmdd0Q7kNvwH9kmbK&_nc_oc=Adqlas4MsfDG5kVdZrdXjulo2wSXXO91xFw8qziDW1QwNzJvlc51w4MPJq9dfH9beoU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-Ij3xxqlyuwbm3YMZ_mY0-qxuWVRSuASOeiOUrkPHuVA&oe=6A2C29A8"}, {"file_name": "IMG_0620.png", "id": "1547078116625666", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619174_1547078119958999_8403208151240748249_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aZCeUmnBkYoQ7kNvwHbaW3t&_nc_oc=AdoaGCeNodSKtim-ScVRzoTi3663R-HMQHj1sENCoONL_hOcgVcqiLKnI3xAsTyTU34&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_6Xcv1cMgHolc7ifb1dK2x8YFKXxCsRZfoV3-jfGUKXA&oe=6A2C11EE"}, {"file_name": "HeroCover_kr_A.png", "id": "1544914920259210", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618472_1544914923592543_20439413943043317_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NBGRO4juxywQ7kNvwGATQEG&_nc_oc=AdpgyorgpMQTz4B_DAWSSOh1XjuvugXwyb6EcXe_YwDMTu0DlJCynTvChB9FOlS1MVI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-DqvX3ZNQ9V3GHp-zjdN1t1x_0QCtWhsiGbz-mIx_i1g&oe=6A2C190D"}, {"file_name": "Cover_kr_A.png", "id": "1180716197305101", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t